DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20220413
SUMMARY:2022/328: Art. 5\, dated provision
DESCRIPTION:'1. It shall be prohibited to directly or indirectly purchase\,
  sell\, provide investment services for or assistance in the issuance of\,
  or otherwise deal with transferable securities and money-market instrumen
 ts with a maturity exceeding 90 days\, issued after 1 August 2014 to 12 Se
 ptember 2014\, or with a maturity exceeding 30 days\, issued after 12 Sept
 ember 2014 to 12 April 2022 or any transferable securities and money marke
 t instruments issued after 12 April 2022 by:'\n'2. It shall be prohibited 
 to directly or indirectly\, purchase\, sell\, provide investment services 
 for or assistance in the issuance of\, or otherwise deal with transferable
  securities and money-market instruments issued after 12 April 2022 by:'\n
 '3. It shall be prohibited to directly or indirectly purchase\, sell\, pro
 vide investment services for or assistance in the issuance of\, or otherwi
 se deal with transferable securities and money-market instruments with a m
 aturity exceeding 30 days\, issued after 12 September 2014 to 12 April 202
 2 or any transferable securities and money market instruments issued after
  12 April 2022 by:'\n'5. It shall be prohibited to list and provide servic
 es as of 12 April 2022 on trading venues registered or recognised in the U
 nion for the transferable securities of any legal person\, entity or body 
 established in Russia and with over 50 % public ownership.'\n'4. It shall 
 be prohibited to directly or indirectly purchase\, sell\, provide investme
 nt services for or assistance in the issuance of\, or otherwise deal with 
 transferable securities and money-market instruments\, issued after 12 Apr
 il 2022 by:'\n\nCouncil Regulation (EU) 2022/328\, instruction 8. Provisio
 n: Art. 5.\nEUR-Lex: https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=C
 ELEX:32022R0328
URL:https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R0328
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
