DESCRIPTION:'transactions\, including sales\, which are strictly necessary 
 for the wind-down\, by 31 December 2026\, of a joint venture or similar le
 gal arrangement concluded before 16 March 2022\, involving a legal person\
 , entity or body referred to in paragraph 1\;'\n'By way of derogation from
  paragraph 1\, the competent authorities may authorise\, under such condit
